Assistant: I see the issue now. The SheetHeader component uses `SheetPrimitives.Close` from Radix UI's Dialog component, which requires a Dialog (Sheet) parent component. Let's fix the preview by wrapping the SheetHeader with a Sheet component.

<file path="apps/web/.temp/dessn-component-routes/SheetHeader-fc56f4fa.tsx">
